nd permanents a side`: each player controls at least that many, `<mark> beside a twin`: a permanent with `+1/+1 counters`, `damage`, `summoning sickness` or `story or time counters` and no other mark, and another of the same name with none), recording `after` more views past it if given. Shots replay one with `?fixture=<name>`, from its nth view with `&at=<n>`.",
